Comment: 0,0:22:46.60,0:22:49.85,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5}跨越无声的夜晚
Comment: 0,0:22:49.85,0:22:53.31,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5}去见你 等待着吧
Comment: 0,0:22:53.31,0:22:58.14,EDCH,,0,0,0,,{\fad(500,500)\bord5\blur5}相信这声音 这思念 相信我吧
